wer.*

# -------- Local redistributable binaries (third-party, fetched on build) --------
# See redist/README.md for how to obtain these.
redist/*
!redist/README.md

# -------- Published / packaged deliverables (regenerable) --------
DIST/
installer/
publish/
*.msi

# -------- Workspace tooling state (not project source) --------
.workbuddy/

# -------- OS / misc --------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
[Dd]esktop.ini
*.lnk

# -------- NuGet --------
.nuget/
*.nupkg
NuGet.Config
packages/
